{"seq":1,"slug":"advanced-decorators","title":"装饰器进阶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/advanced-decorators","wordCount":835,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"装饰器进阶\">装饰器进阶</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>装饰器是 Python 元编程最常用的工具。基础装饰器大家已经熟悉，本文聚焦进阶用法：参数化装饰器、类装饰器、装饰器栈的执行顺序，以及如何编写类型安全的装饰器。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>装饰器的本质是<strong>接受可调用对象并返回新可调用对象的函数</strong>——<code>@my_decorator</code> 只是 <code>greet = my_decorator(greet)</code> 的语法糖。从这一句出发可以推出进阶用法的全部规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>元信息会丢失</strong>：包装函数替换了原函数，<code>__name__</code>、<code>__doc__</code> 等不再正确，必须用 <code>@functools.wraps</code> 还原。</li>\n<li><strong>参数化需要三层嵌套</strong>：外层收参数、中层收函数、内层执行逻辑；想同时兼容 <code>@deco</code> 与 <code>@deco(...)</code>，就要靠默认参数区分。</li>\n<li><strong>栈顺序是&quot;由内向外包装、由外向内执行&quot;</strong>：<code>@a @b @c</code> 等价于 <code>a(b(c(f)))</code>，调用时前置钩子从外到内、后置钩子从内到外。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>解法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>元信息</td>\n<td><code>__name__</code> 变成 wrapper</td>\n<td><code>@functools.wraps</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型签名</td>\n<td>装饰后签名丢失</td>\n<td><code>ParamSpec</code> + <code>Callable[P, R]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有参/无参兼容</td>\n<td>两种调用方式</td>\n<td>默认参数 + 分支返回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态保持</td>\n<td>需要闭包内的可变状态</td>\n<td>用类实现装饰器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"装饰器本质\">装饰器本质</h2><p>装饰器是一个接受函数（或类）并返回新函数（或类）的可调用对象：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def my_decorator(func):&#10;    def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):&#10;        print(&quot;Before&quot;)&#10;        result = func(*args, **kwargs)&#10;        print(&quot;After&quot;)&#10;        return result&#10;    return wrapper&#10;&#10;@my_decorator&#10;def greet(name: str) -&gt; str:&#10;    return f&quot;Hello, {name}&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> my_decorator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(func):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wrapper</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Before\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> func(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"After\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wrapper</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@my_decorator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Hello, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>等价于 <code>greet = my_decorator(greet)</code>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"保留原函数元信息\">保留原函数元信息</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from functools import wraps&#10;&#10;def my_decorator(func):&#10;    @wraps(func)&#10;    def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):&#10;        return func(*args, **kwargs)&#10;    return wrapper\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> functools </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wraps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> my_decorator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(func):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @wraps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(func)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wrapper</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> func(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wrapper</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>不用 wraps</th>\n<th>用 wraps</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>__name__</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;wrapper&quot;</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;greet&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>__doc__</code></td>\n<td>wrapper 的文档</td>\n<td>原函数文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>__module__</code></td>\n<td>装饰器所在模块</td>\n<td>原函数模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>__wrapped__</code></td>\n<td>不存在</td>\n<td>指向原函数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"参数化装饰器\">参数化装饰器</h2><p>参数化装饰器需要三层嵌套：外层接收参数，中层接收函数，内层执行逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from functools import wraps&#10;import time&#10;&#10;def retry(max_attempts: int = 3, delay: float = 1.0):&#10;    def decorator(func):&#10;        @wraps(func)&#10;        def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):&#10;            for attempt in range(1, max_attempts + 1):&#10;                try:&#10;                    return func(*args, **kwargs)&#10;                except Exception as e:&#10;                    if attempt == max_attempts:&#10;                        raise&#10;                    time.sleep(delay)&#10;        return wrapper&#10;    return decorator&#10;&#10;@retry(max_attempts=5, delay=0.5)&#10;def fetch_data(url: str) -&gt; str:&#10;    ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> functools </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wraps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(max_attempts: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, delay: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-da