unc(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.perf_counter() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.func.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__name__}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> took </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">elapsed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">s\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@Timer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n))</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"装饰器栈执行顺序\">装饰器栈执行顺序</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@decorator_a&#10;@decorator_b&#10;@decorator_c&#10;def func(): ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@decorator_a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@decorator_b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@decorator_c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(): </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>等价于 <code>func = decorator_a(decorator_b(decorator_c(func)))</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始函数] --&gt; C[decorator_c 包装]&#10;  C --&gt; B[decorator_b 包装]&#10;  B --&gt; D[decorator_a 包装]&#10;  D --&gt; E[最终调用]\">graph TD\n  A[原始函数] --&gt; C[decorator_c 包装]\n  C --&gt; B[decorator_b 包装]\n  B --&gt; D[decorator_a 包装]\n  D --&gt; E[最终调用]</pre><p>调用时执行顺序：A 的前置 → B 的前置 → C 的前置 → 原函数 → C 的后置 → B 的后置 → A 的后置。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型安全的装饰器\">类型安全的装饰器</h2><p>使用 <code>ParamSpec</code> 让装饰后的函数保留原始签名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import ParamSpec, TypeVar, Callable&#10;from functools import wraps&#10;&#10;P = ParamSpec(&quot;P&quot;)&#10;R = TypeVar(&quot;R&quot;)&#10;&#10;def logged(func: Callable[P, R]) -&gt; Callable[P, R]:&#10;    @wraps(func)&#10;    def wrapper(*args: P.args, **kwargs: P.kwargs) -&gt; R:&#10;        print(f&quot;Calling {func.__name__}&quot;)&#10;        return func(*args, **kwargs)&#10;    return wrapper\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ParamSpec, TypeVar, Callable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> functools </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wraps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">P </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ParamSpec(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">R </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVar(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"R\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> logged</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(func: Callable[P, R]) -> Callable[P, R]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @wraps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(func)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wrapper</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args: P.args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs: P.kwargs) -> R:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Calling </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">func.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__name__}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> func(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wrapper</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见装饰器模式速查\">常见装饰器模式速查</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>典型实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缓存</td>\n<td>避免重复计算</td>\n<td><code>@functools.cache</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重试</td>\n<td>自动重试失败操作</td>\n<td>自定义 retry</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限检查</td>\n<td>控制函数访问</td>\n<td>Flask <code>@login_required</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注册</td>\n<td>收集函数到注册表</td>\n<td>插件系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志</td>\n<td>记录调用信息</td>\n<td>自定义 logged</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证</td>\n<td>校验参数合法性</td>\n<td>beartype</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>始终使用 <code>@wraps</code> 保留原函数的元信息</li>\n<li>参数化装饰器使用关键字参数提升可读性</li>\n<li>使用 <code>ParamSpec</code> 让装饰器对类型检查器透明</li>\n<li>装饰器栈不宜超过 3 层，过深会增加调试难度</li>\n<li>优先使用标准库装饰器（<code>@cache</code>、<code>@property</code>）而非重新发明</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>装饰器本质是&quot;接受可调用对象、返回新可调用对象&quot;，<code>@</code> 只是赋值语法糖。</li>\n<li>始终用 <code>@functools.wraps</code> 保留元信息，否则 <code>__name__</code>、<code>__doc__</code> 会被覆盖。</li>\n<li>参数化装饰器需三层嵌套；用默认参数与分支返回兼容有参/无参两种调用。</li>\n<li>装饰器可作用于函数或类，也可以用类（实现 <code>__call__</code>）来写装饰器以携带状态。</li>\n<li>装饰器栈由内向外包装、由外向内执行，后置逻辑顺序相反。</li>\n<li>用 <code>ParamSpec</code> 让装饰器对类型检查器透明，装饰器栈不宜超过 3 层。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"装饰器进阶","id":"装饰器进阶"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"装饰器本质","id":"装饰器本质"},{"level":2,"text":"保留原函数元信息","id":"保留原函数元信息"},{"level":2,"text":"参数化装饰器","id":"参数化装饰器"},{"level":3,"text":"兼容有参/无参调用","id":"兼容有参-无参调用"},{"level":2,"text":"类装饰器","id":"类装饰器"},{"level":3,"text":"用类实现装饰器","id":"用类实现装饰器"},{"level":2,"text":"装饰器栈执行顺序","id":"装饰器栈执行顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"类型安全的装饰器","id":"类型安全的装饰器"},{"level":2,"text":"常见装饰器模式速查","id":"常见装饰器模式速查"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"并发模式与最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/concurrency-patterns"},"next":{"title":"描述符与属性协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/descriptors"}}